[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719766326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114129#issuecomment-3719766326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114129","id":3719766326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dtyE2","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T16:44:14Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T16:44:34Z","body":"I'm pretty sure it isn't a deliberate omission because the value `2` is exposed to GDScript, it just doesn't have a corresponding enum constant. Make an AudioStreamInteractive, and without adding clips, enable the (any, any) transition with Transition To: Prev Position:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"667\" height=\"613\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7da3bfc-eb53-478f-9e83-691ba9c7428e\" />\r\n\r\nNow inspect it:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends AudioStreamPlayer\r\n\r\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar asi := (stream as AudioStreamInteractive)\r\n\tfor name in ClassDB.class_get_enum_constants(&\"AudioStreamInteractive\", &\"TransitionToTime\"):\r\n\t\tprints(name, ClassDB.class_get_integer_constant(&\"AudioStreamInteractive\", name))\r\n\tvar ttt: AudioStreamInteractive.TransitionToTime = asi.get_transition_to_time(AudioStreamInteractive.CLIP_ANY, AudioStreamInteractive.CLIP_ANY)\r\n\tprint(ttt)\r\n```\r\n\r\n`ttt` has static type `AudioStreamInteractive.TransitionToTime` so you would expect its value to correspond to one of the integer constants retrieved in the loop above, but there is no `2`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nTRANSITION_TO_TIME_SAME_POSITION 0\r\nTRANSITION_TO_TIME_START 1\r\n2\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719766326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719788857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114129#issuecomment-3719788857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114129","id":3719788857,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dt3k5","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T16:49:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T16:49:31Z","body":"If you try to add such a transition in code:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n\tasi.add_transition(\r\n\t\tAudioStreamInteractive.CLIP_ANY,\r\n\t\tAudioStreamInteractive.CLIP_ANY,\r\n\t\tAudioStreamInteractive.TRANSITION_FROM_TIME_IMMEDIATE,\r\n\t\t2,  #  TRANSITION_TO_TIME_PREVIOUS_POSITION,\r\n\t\tAudioStreamInteractive.FADE_AUTOMATIC,\r\n\t\t0.0,\r\n\t)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nYou get these two warnings, but the call succeeds:\r\n\r\n```\r\nW 0:00:00:481   GDScript::reload: Integer used when an enum value is expected. If this is intended, cast the integer to the enum type using the \"as\" keyword.\r\n  <C++ Error>   INT_AS_ENUM_WITHOUT_CAST\r\n  <C++ Source>  test.tscn::GDScript_ykrsh:12 @ GDScript::reload()\r\n\r\nW 0:00:00:481   GDScript::reload: Cannot pass 2 as Enum \"AudioStreamInteractive.TransitionToTime\": no enum member has matching value.\r\n  <C++ Error>   INT_AS_ENUM_WITHOUT_MATCH\r\n  <C++ Source>  test.tscn::GDScript_ykrsh:12 @ GDScript::reload()\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719788857/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338742847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114129#issuecomment-4338742847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114129","id":4338742847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABApv2Pw","user":{"login":"wjt","id":86760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt","html_url":"https://github.com/wjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T20:17:05Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T20:17:05Z","body":"Thank you!\r\n\r\n> @wjt The PR needs a rebase to be mergable.\r\n\r\nDone. (I confess that I didn't build the rebased commit locally, I'm relying on GHA for that.)\r\n\r\n> Not sure if it will make it into 4.7 - we're past feature freeze, though this PR isn't doing anything new, so perhaps it could be seen as a bugfix.\r\n\r\nI would personally agree that it's a bugfix not a feature, but it's not up to me :-)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338742847/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4345829580","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114129#issuecomment-4345829580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114129","id":4345829580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAwgYzA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rep